    "long_instructions": "You’re given a Python program to restore the logbooks and count how many artifacts were found at each site. In the next few levels, you’ll finish this program. Archaeologists are counting on you!\r\n\r\nFirst, combine each logbook into a single dataset. Your program will raise an error when you run it—you’ll fix that next.\r\n\r\n**☑️ Do This:**\r\n- Read `logbook_3.csv` and add its rows to `rows`.\r\n\r\n**💻 Coding Tip**\r\n\r\n- You can follow the pattern established for `logbook_1.csv` and `logbook_2.csv`.\r\n",
